      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ Notification.set_Content",
      "Translated": "已安装角色数据同步。请使用 /pcharsync 打开设置，完成配置并重启游戏后即可生效。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Character Data Sync has been loaded in the middle of gameplay so it has automatically disabled itself. It will not function until you restart your game.",
      "Context": "CharacterSyncPlugin..ctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ Notification.set_Content",
      "Translated": "角色数据同步在游戏运行期间加载，已自动停用。请重启游戏以启用。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
